msgstr "Redfish BMC: %s"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Host name or IP address of the BMC, without https:// or a path."
msgstr "Ime hosta ili IP adresa BMC-a, bez https:// i bez putanje."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Do not verify is logged when set and shown as a warning on the health page while it stays."
msgstr "Opcija bez provjere se bilježi u zapisnik kada se postavi i prikazuje kao upozorenje na stranici stanja dok god ostane uključena."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "CA Bundle File"
msgstr "Datoteka CA paketa"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "For the CA bundle mode: absolute path on the poller to a PEM file that others cannot write."
msgstr "Za način rada sa CA paketom: apsolutna putanja na polleru do PEM datoteke u koju drugi korisnici ne mogu pisati."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "For the pinned mode: base64 SHA-256 of the BMC public key, as sha256//... or the bare hash. A changed key fails until this is updated."
msgstr "Za prikvačeni način rada: base64 SHA-256 javnog ključa BMC-a, u obliku sha256//... ili samo čisti sažetak. Promijenjen ključ neće proći dok se ovo polje ne ažurira."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Public Key Pin"
msgstr "Prikvačeni javni ključ"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Allow Basic Authentication Fallback"
msgstr "Dozvoli rezervnu Basic autentifikaciju"

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "Used only when the BMC offers no session service. Every request then carries the password; the health page warns while it is in use."
msgstr "Koristi se samo kada BMC ne nudi servis sesija. Svaki zahtjev tada sadrži lozinku; stranica stanja prikazuje upozorenje dok god se to koristi."

#: lib/BmcsPage.php
msgid "The Cacti device of the server this BMC manages. Leave it at none to have the plugin create a device from the list."
msgstr "Cacti uređaj servera kojim ovaj BMC upravlja. Ostavite na nijedan ako želite da dodatak kreira uređaj sa spiska."

