#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "A BMC account with the ReadOnly role. The plugin never needs a role that can change BMC state."
msgstr "BMC nalog sa ulogom ReadOnly. Dodatku nikada nije potrebna uloga koja može mijenjati stanje BMC-a."

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "A password is stored. Leave blank to keep it."
msgstr "Lozinka je sačuvana. Ostavite prazno da je zadržite."

#: lib/CredentialsPage.php
msgid "Stored encrypted with the vault key."
msgstr "Sačuvano šifrovano ključem trezora."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed completely. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Redfish šabloni nisu u potpunosti instalirani. Ponovo ih instalirajte sa stranice Redfish BMC-ovi."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "A device \"%s\" from the %s device template, polled by poller %d, with availability checks off. Its host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Uređaj \"%s\" iz šablona uređaja %s, koji ispituje poller %d, sa isključenim provjerama dostupnosti. Njegovo ime hosta je rezervisano ime koje se nikada ne kontaktira."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The data query \"%s\", with a graph for each of the %d members known now."
msgstr "Upit podataka \"%s\", sa po jednim grafom za svakog od %d trenutno poznatih članova."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d fans or power supplies that were present are no longer reported. They count as failed until you confirm; confirming accepts the members the BMC reports now."
msgstr "%d ventilatora ili napajanja koja su ranije bila prisutna više se ne prijavljuju. Računaju se kao neispravna dok ne potvrdite; potvrdom se prihvataju članovi koje BMC trenutno prijavljuje."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "The graph \"%s\", with its \"%s\" data source."
msgstr "Graf \"%s\" sa svojim izvorom podataka \"%s\"."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC is already mapped to a device."
msgstr "BMC je već mapiran na uređaj."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
#, php-format
msgid "Created by the Redfish plugin for BMC %s. Its values come from the plugin cache; the host name is a reserved name that is never contacted."
msgstr "Kreirao Redfish dodatak za BMC %s. Vrijednosti dolaze iz keša dodatka; ime hosta je rezervisano ime koje se nikada ne kontaktira."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "Cacti refused to create the device. See the Cacti log."
msgstr "Cacti je odbio kreirati uređaj. Pogledajte Cacti zapisnik."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The new device would be hidden from you by your device permissions, so it was removed again. Ask an administrator to grant access, or map the BMC to a device you can see."
msgstr "Novi uređaj bi vam bio skriven zbog vaših dozvola za uređaje, pa je ponovo uklonjen. Zatražite od administratora pristup ili mapirajte BMC na uređaj koji možete vidjeti."

#: lib/DeviceProvisioner.php
msgid "The BMC was mapped to a device by someone else meanwhile, or could not be mapped, so the new device was removed again. Reload the page and check its mapping."
msgstr "U međuvremenu je neko drugi mapirao BMC na uređaj ili mapiranje nije uspjelo, pa je novi uređaj ponovo uklonjen. Osvježite stranicu i provjerite mapiranje."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Redfish templates could not be installed: %s"
msgstr "Redfish šablone nije bilo moguće instalirati: %s"

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
msgid "The Redfish templates are not installed or not current. Reinstall them from the Redfish BMCs page."
msgstr "Redfish šabloni nisu instalirani ili nisu aktuelni. Ponovo ih instalirajte sa stranice Redfish BMC-ovi."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its Cacti device was deleted. Map it to another device or create one from the BMCs page."
msgstr "%s: njegov Cacti uređaj je obrisan. Mapirajte ga na drugi uređaj ili kreirajte novi sa stranice BMC-ovi."

#: lib/DeviceWarnings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: its device is polled by poller %d but the BMC is read by poller %d. Move one of them so both use the same poller, or its graphs can read as unknown."
msgstr "%s: njegov uređaj ispituje poller %d, ali BMC čita poller %d. Premjestite jedan od njih tako da oba koriste isti poller, inače grafovi mogu prikazivati nepoznate vrijednosti."

